<title>USA: Rollins sets two million share buyback.</title>
<headline>Rollins sets two million share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rollins Inc said on Tuesday its board authorized the repurchase of up to two million additional shares of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>Purchases would be made from time to time on the open market at prevailing market prices, it said.</p>
<p>Rollins owns and operates Orkin Exterminating Co Inc, which offers termite and pest control services. It also provides lawn care and plantscaping services and electronic security systems.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1610))</p>
